# Settings for a production build. This file is committed.
#
# The structure store is a public R2 bucket that holds the predicted coordinates.
# Its address is public by design — the same as the site's own data directory —
# so it belongs here rather than in the dashboard settings, and a clone of the
# repository builds a site that can already show structures.
#
# Leave the variable unset and the platform behaves as it did before the feature
# existed: the viewer renders nothing and no structure is claimed.
VITE_STRUCTURE_BASE_URL=https://pub-e92779d3b73e46229f1118ce915547d4.r2.dev
